 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": -0.9,
   "t1": 3.6,
   "text": "The sunlight on your face",
   "style": "big",
   "y": 0.4
  },
  {
   "t0": 1.4,
   "t1": 3.6,
   "text": "is *old.*",
   "style": "big",
   "y": 0.56
  },
  {
   "t0": 4.0,
   "t1": 7.0,
   "text": "You've heard it's 8 minutes old.",
   "style": "mid",
   "strike": [
    18,
    27
   ]
  },
  {
   "t0": 7.2,
   "t1": 9.7,
   "text": "It's *thousands of years* old.",
   "style": "mid"
  },
  {
   "t0": 13.4,
   "t1": 15.6,
   "text": "the journey of a sunbeam",
   "style": "kicker",
   "y": 0.15
  },
  {
   "t0": 16.5,
   "t1": 19.5,
   "text": "Let's start at the end.",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.8
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.0,
   "t1": 23.6,
   "text": "The last leg is *150 million km.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.82
  },
  {
   "t0": 30.0,
   "t1": 33.6,
   "text": "At light speed: *8 min 20 s.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.82
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.0,
   "t1": 37.6,
   "text": "That's the *easy* part.",
   "style": "big",
   "y": 0.5
  },
  {
   "t0": 40.8,
   "t1": 43.8,
   "text": "The hard part is getting *out.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.86
  },
  {
   "t0": 57.0,
   "t1": 61.0,
   "text": "Our light is born in the *core.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.86
  },
  {
   "t0": 63.0,
   "t1": 66.6,
   "text": "15 million °C. Crushed by the|weight of the *whole Sun.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.8
  },
  {
   "t0": 67.0,
   "t1": 74.6,
   "text": "Four hydrogen nuclei…",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.16
  },
  {
   "t0": 70.2,
   "t1": 74.6,
   "text": "…end up as one *helium.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.84
  },
  {
   "t0": 72.4,
   "t1": 74.6,
   "text": "Plus a flash of *energy.*",
   "style": "kicker",
   "y": 0.93
  },
  {
   "t0": 75.6,
   "t1": 80.6,
   "text": "This happens to *600 million tonnes*|of hydrogen. Every second.",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.8
  },
  {
   "t0": 81.0,
   "t1": 87.0,
   "text": "About *4 million tonnes* of it simply|vanishes, turned into energy.",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.8
  },
  {
   "t0": 89.2,
   "t1": 92.0,
   "text": "Our energy sets off at *light speed.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.84
  },
  {
   "t0": 92.3,
   "t1": 95.0,
   "text": "It gets *a few millimetres*…",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.84
  },
  {
   "t0": 95.3,
   "t1": 98.6,
   "text": "…hits a particle and is flung|somewhere *random.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.8
  },
  {
   "t0": 99.0,
   "t1": 100.4,
   "text": "Again.",
   "style": "pop",
   "y": 0.5,
   "x": 0.3
  },
  {
   "t0": 100.5,
   "t1": 101.9,
   "text": "And again.",
   "style": "pop",
   "y": 0.36,
   "x": 0.68
  },
  {
   "t0": 102.0,
   "t1": 103.6,
   "text": "And *again.*",
   "style": "pop",
   "y": 0.7,
   "x": 0.5
  },
  {
   "t0": 104.6,
   "t1": 108.6,
   "text": "This is a *random walk.*",
   "style": "big",
   "y": 0.84
  },
  {
   "t0": 109.0,
   "t1": 113.6,
   "text": "Crossing the Sun like this takes|*billions of trillions* of bounces.",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.82
  },
  {
   "t0": 114.4,
   "t1": 121.6,
   "text": "Estimates range from about 10,000 to 170,000 years",
   "style": "kicker",
   "y": 0.86
  },
  {
   "t0": 122.4,
   "t1": 129.2,
   "text": "Strictly, no single photon makes the trip: each one is absorbed|and a new one sent on. The *energy* is what makes the journey.",
   "style": "note",
   "y": 0.82
  },
  {
   "t0": 130.5,
   "t1": 134.0,
   "text": "Near the top, the Sun starts to *boil.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.84
  },
  {
   "t0": 134.4,
   "t1": 139.6,
   "text": "Hot plasma rises. Cools. Sinks. *Rises again.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.84
  },
  {
   "t0": 140.0,
   "t1": 144.6,
   "text": "Carried like this, the last 200,000 km|takes just *months.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.8
  },
  {
   "t0": 145.4,
   "t1": 151.2,
   "text": "Each bubble on the surface is|about the size of *Texas.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.8
  },
  {
   "t0": 152.6,
   "t1": 155.6,
   "text": "Then, finally, it's *free.*",
   "style": "big",
   "y": 0.5
  },
  {
   "t0": 156.0,
   "t1": 159.6,
   "text": "8 minutes 20 seconds later…",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.84
  },
  {
   "t0": 160.0,
   "t1": 162.7,
   "text": "…it lands on *you.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.84
  },
  {
   "t0": 163.0,
   "t1": 167.2,
   "text": "Neutrinos from the same core skip all of it.|They're out in about *2 seconds.*",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.82
  },
  {
   "t0": 167.5,
   "t1": 171.8,
   "text": "About *65 billion* of them pass through|your fingernail every second.",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.82
  },
  {
   "t0": 172.6,
   "t1": 176.6,
   "text": "So next time the Sun is on your face…",
   "style": "mid",
   "y": 0.5
  },
  {
   "t0": 177.0,
   "t1": 181.0,
   "text": "remember it set off before|history was *written.*",
   "style": "big",
   "y": 0.5
  },
  {
   "t0": 183.0,
   "t1": 186.5,
   "text": "the journey of a sunbeam",
   "style": "kicker",
   "y": 0.72
  }
 ],
